  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EISA 2023-2025 (ADS V)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EISA 2023-2025 (ADS V)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EISA st&#xf6;djer valprocesser genom r&#xe5;dgivning, tekniskt st&#xf6;d till valmyndigheter och andra akt&#xf6;rer p&#xe5; nationell, regional och kontinental niv&#xe5; i Afrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EISA supports electoral processes with advice, technical support to electoral management bodies and other actors at the national, regional and continental level in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme goal of the intervention is &quot;credible electoral and democratic poitical processes in Africa, with greater citizen inclusion ad participation, at the regional, subregional and national level&quot;.

Five outcomes (or objectives) are identified below this overall goal:

(1) promotion and advancement of democratic processes and institutions in Africa,

(2) delivery of credible and trustworthy electoral processes and systems,

(3) representative institutions are inclusive and representative and responsive,

(4) political institutions offer choices based [sic] the aspirations of the electorate,

and

(5) EISA is leading African expert organization in democracy and elections in Africa</narrative>
  </description>
